      },
      {
         "id": "b0c0ac8e-f812-41a4-88c8-0f3eafb1c872",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "1aae32d7-8b8a-49d9-b136-f859e24a53e6",
               "text": "Weisstein, Eric W",
               "page": "https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Pyramid.html",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            },
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "ffffd208-eb09-4da3-b516-f8bc695758dd",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content\u0026arg=ffffd208-eb09-4da3-b516-f8bc695758dd",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### A definição\n\nPara compararmos pirâmides, necessitamos primeiro definir o que é uma pirâmide.\n\nPara isso, utilizaremos a definição de Eric W. Weisstein: pirâmides *são uma figura geométrica com uma base fechada e cujas faces laterais são triângulos que se encontram em um ponto comum no topo, chamado ápice*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "\u003cimg src=\"http://www.historytracers.org/images/HistoryTracers/pentagonal_pyramid.jpg\" id=\"img0\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('img0', '0%')\"  class=\"imgcenter\"/\u003e",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": [],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "*Pirâmide de Base Pentagonal seguindo definição matemática*",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "ee2d3587-30a6-4a45-9032-555441b3b829",
